    "lawCode": "Amd §911, Exec L",
    "lawSection": "Executive Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S1148\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the executive law, in relation to designating the\nLittle River in the Adirondack state park as an inland waterway\n\n\n PURPOSE :\nTo include the Little River in the Adirondack state park as an inland\nwaterway.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nSection one amends subdivision 4 of section 911 of the executive law\ndesignating the Little River in the Adirondack state park as an inland\nwaterway.\n\nSection two provides for an immediate effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nBy adding the Little River in the Adirondack state park as an inland\nwaterway, it could then be included in Local Waterfront Revitalization\nProgram activities. This designation would greatly assist waterfront\nrevitalization efforts in the communities surrounding these Waterways.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediate.\n",
